OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSunny spells and isolated,
OL,6,Fmainly coastal showers to start. Cloud
OL,7,Fincreasing through the day, with a few
OL,8,Finland light showers possible, then
OL,9,Fbecoming dry later in the afternoon.
OL,10,FBreezy to start, especially near
OL,11,Fcoasts, then winds falling light.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FAny lingering showers soon
OL,14,Fclearing this evening. Becoming dry
OL,15,Fwith some clear spells. Light winds to
OL,16,Fstart, becoming breezy toward the end
OL,17,Fof the night. Feeling chilly.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
