OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FA dry but cloudy and breezy
OL,6,Fstart. Becoming increasingly windy as
OL,7,Foutbreaks of rain, perhaps heavy at
OL,8,Ftimes, spread eastward through the
OL,9,Fafternoon and evening.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FSunny
OL,12,Fintervals and possible isolated
OL,13,Fshowers Friday. Cloudy with heavy rain
OL,14,FSaturday. Mostly cloudy with
OL,15,Foccasional showers Sunday.
OL,16,FTemperatures trending a little above
OL,17,Faverage.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
